Welcome to the world of rhythm and music! We are pleased to present you our new application - a metronome, which will become your reliable assistant in creating new rhythms.
Our metronome will not only allow you to set the desired tempo, but also provide the ability to create complex rhythmic combinations. You can run multiple metronomes at the same time and create a unique soundscape for your creations.

But that is not all! In our application you can customize the metronome sound to suit your tastes and tasks, change the volume and find your best groove. Our metronome not only has a wide list of features, but also a nice design that will delight you every time you use it to create your music.

Be creative and experiment with our metronome - you are sure to find something in it that will help you unleash your creative potential and create works that will delight you and your listeners.

What is available in our application:
• several metronome modes, differing in their complexity and functionality;
• polyrhythmic mode to find the right groove;
• many rhythm presets;
• 8 different specially created metronome sound packs;
• volume setting;
• background mode of the application;

